#: scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 914321a026f27053c57cdcb3d6b716fa6252219976fc44df5d16fa85ef71932b
#. default-sha256: cee995ac77e65d84f2f54e56b922c8fc7d906d8ac0261271e2b96d2e0de64496
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After being pierced by Didier’s blade,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I found myself looking down upon my own "
"corpse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……長兄ディディエの剣により命を失った私は……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫気付けば、⟪k:3⟫その自分自身の姿を見下ろし"
"ていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a33db88ddcc101cb0c1da2df0532f45b9e73f970f2a1b4110560a7b6b8f95e7a
#. default-sha256: 9953f723ced47260e2c75827540597839ec7182e192e705b943d0eec74f151b9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched as my eldest brother dragged me to the place of my crucifixion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は、⟪k:1⟫兄の手によって、⟪k:2⟫磔の場へと引きずられていくその姿を……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫自分の目で……見"
"ていたのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc86d3b64f4a9c9c3eaae7fc327e5ae36fe8439837d7c03c21060ca41a30d912
#. default-sha256: 053422ec1f3ed71093d1629c64189fa584155118b43504378dca82385c7d4863
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The knights!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫騎士様！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d89d12edeaaaca33b82d13d8aeb8e3ba85843fc641ae3b63397ca5e15d6c738
#. default-sha256: c63d19640a183fae3f927015bd462509147306c8c64470484d41bd627671bfac
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men who had come to ransack the mansion were standing there, staring at my body in awe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫かつて私の屋敷を襲いに来た者たちが……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫恍惚とした表情を浮かべながら、⟪k:3⟫私の死体を見"
"ているのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 768b08010910012bfe95e19ffe957e00722f2d7dd23c5485688852734fd931e0
#. default-sha256: cd66aa7451c8698a8955b110b147775c6413c8ca51dd26b7e13ad4b9d567e0b2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, the Lord’s judgment has been delivered unto the witch of the cursed mansion by His holy "
"servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ああ……⟪k:1⟫これぞ神のご意志だ。⟪k:2⟫あの呪われた館に住み着いた魔女を、⟪k:3⟫騎士の方々がついに"
"裁きを与えたのだ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56482352202449a3e24ae4bb5ca012f1ca8b43e617f1147fec7f8a428c430520
#. default-sha256: c34c2fff1c8a1099bd78e2bfded0936c686039258510c6e1f8d6077630c662af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We have assembled all the tools you need to execute your divine mission. ⟪k:1⟫A cross, "
"befitting of such a heinous sinner!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫さあ、⟪k:1⟫騎士様。⟪k:2⟫準備は整っております。⟪k:3⟫呪われた魔女に相応しき十字架が、⟪k:4⟫ここ"
"に！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a91d4ce6eb09a96faf239c857a0d28e9b008b2277aebf2f87561066c1119376
#. default-sha256: 3565f48ba09151f2bc83383a1161d3b5be7dadf99b725652cb8c0fbe7c45fc00
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That witch threatened to curse us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sullied our pure ears with its blasphemy!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その魔女は我々に呪いを振りかけようとしたのです！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫無実な我々に向けて、⟪k:3⟫呪いの言葉"
"を吐いたのです！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 344b4ba62b51441f0bd9fa5f6fdb583181fdf8bc986ffaeca5ff79cd39a448e3
#. default-sha256: c19bc0890f863eaad9321a05bf1bb5493f2e64bdc4f1cdb7e262046f9f6eb2cb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had done no such thing...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hadn’t cursed anyone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had merely been "
"defending myself..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は何もしていない……。⟪k:1⟫誰ひとりとして呪ってなどいない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私はただ、⟪k:4⟫自分の身"
"を守っただけだった……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4dd37ec71d0bbc1a196e3d4eca7da1419cbb84f13f413e967fb328de0f1f918
#. default-sha256: 3bc8ed2c1766caaf1066eaf3362dc23d05ec2e4d907946c29621d29a3ad4d48b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had been armed and outnumbered me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so I had said what was necessary to chase "
"them off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫武器を手にした民衆から、⟪k:1⟫この身を守るために……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ただそれだけのために、⟪k:4⟫言葉"
"を用いただけだった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21f87c5fe8f33922ffa647d420932c25450f2b5b6565afe071b943fb47862c6b
#. default-sha256: 32f2703323aebd023a02131c99ced70cff4acafc2b57e9517fb9790e01e25afc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our poor harvest and our suffering at the hands of the greedy lord were all the work of the "
"witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫我々が領主の悪政に苦しんだのも――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ここ暫くの不作も！⟪k:4⟫　すべてその魔女"
"が企てたのです！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a621b82b38f3765552461f56600736f905fa723aba6f6b559332628a7d6a543
#. default-sha256: 094be7208b9b0ddad701d9e20e3ed3d95dd0f89df22a917cd296550a076e005b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I prayed. ⟪k:1⟫I asked God to grant me the smallest of miracles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫私の死体を担ぐ兄に……請うしかなかったのだ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫どうか神よ、⟪k:4⟫たった少し"
"の奇跡で良いから――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ddb96d3969e07b1b8f2756a145bc8b9201f00889250fe1d433a735825aa87c
#. default-sha256: c51937da3709d1cd9d52fd4ca6f177a7ce3d91b87b1292fe42b925d6a033b1ea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To let my voice reach my brother, who carried my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私の声を、⟪k:1⟫彼に届けて欲しいと……そう願いながら。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f798bc20b271239c0d07b24dcff3a1b19bb085d62cd8d61a99a357dc9bdfea97
#. default-sha256: 95ec7834c9c54e55bc9a751d790ab75cccd8b5b4bc3a22a6d3831a9d4bd338c8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know me better than that...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know I’ve done nothing wrong..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫兄さん……、⟪k:1⟫貴方なら、⟪k:2⟫分かるはずでしょう……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私が何の罪も犯していないこと"
"を……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86b6564cf54bff99fae5af07e561d075abaa2697e1a72e8bf9823aad414b5c74
#. default-sha256: e13735f2b541795d774ce70f14ed99aa159d127ad5e9c2930851d33e2c2035f9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those men smirking at the sight of my body...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they’re the ones putting the blame "
"for their sins on me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私の死体を見て笑っている彼らこそ、⟪k:1⟫かつて罪を犯し――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それを私に押し付けているのだ"
"と……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b45ce2e34bf6cb01e342a5a9c1bb40b3e8253035e43f686907279162a9f33f70
#. default-sha256: 4ab48b535c7a9239238d852777816dda995474d182673930001a9fe595dd3a9c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫ can give me a respectable burial..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫せめて貴方だけが私を知り、⟪k:1⟫手厚く葬ってください……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b16f1418eeaaa85fbefcbf3975a83e6c1a92a03bf435901f530f41a79dd57b47
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10df7fe49e680a41aa793ff86fd15ccee398ea4e595cdcbae6b24e4fe9920f94
#. default-sha256: 15df051331bdf3d9c5b9d15e6a712642384d21052db2b44cbc9961423c8ce4a4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you say nothing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうして、⟪k:1⟫その男から――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fadcf196c55a8c0de25b9376e3de41cb96221472d9b090ebf36b4f84a09e0bb0
#. default-sha256: c040f78003a10843ce262eb514be09edb33f4dedb89ec857838855a16bd60c01
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you accept the tools this man presents you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を罰する道具を受け取り、⟪k:1⟫そして――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f46c254ea36eaeb871123b6f2bad09b4cfe9ddce13a68e7ab11ff51ff6511f0b
#. default-sha256: 750eb138aeadda37e8189c651f08ff28d7ac96ad0b3a16fe19e135565f7307c3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫tools meant to punish me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何も言わずに頷いてしまうのですか……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 545abdc27ea17b9f58534559aeb34fa54f606c913636ee5a58fc8e4e2bd68edf
#. default-sha256: 07dea957248ddf36f27a7d23b47c53b5e4c3e405bbdb928188fb64b1c5a5bd0f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tell me, Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてですか、⟪k:1⟫兄さん……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 926ff58a5d3ebb6447a3ee0ebcf0490c2ae65300057b70afb1a2e8446d26e3f3
#. default-sha256: 17230ff6fe7da9151933596a72b7f855c68f6ccf3f68cbc32a661cc167e81f06
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫十字架を！！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b97770e57f0b7ed0632f96f9a35fc58d4d2e59eac5c81f33a52e606bae66124a
#. default-sha256: a336413878aec310184ac13cf6789a8235627119d0e582d09566325f065e1c19
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Please, anything but that... ⟪k:1⟫I’m begging you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫don’t expose me to these "
"people..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お願いです、⟪k:1⟫それだけは……、⟪k:2⟫それだけはやめてください……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私の肉体を、⟪k:5⟫民"
"衆の前に晒すことだけは――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bde0a943be95eac7ce87f51c4807469a64316fde43cc5879cfbd3e595e2f0786
#. default-sha256: 8d0a5e5264f7c5b33c46251830e6eda4c36869ec1faf605d249087d7dfad7cc8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t expose my body, Didier!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうかやめてください、⟪k:1⟫兄さん……！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64b61bd875e235bcb1d58a2f32364e1d0e16cc7864938ac1e9d5b69790f8d91c
#. default-sha256: 416e107506c1ece5e8c564f53c8ab6b730532bcdff63571d93da6a23a055c266
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m begging you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それだけは、⟪k:1⟫どうか……！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d40e3a3ef7b8fa08ba6a114540e7b7beb6f14699942e9ed348ee4536c0cd10a
#. default-sha256: f13a69a20763d21937903963f1ea0a28f08a906915cfbe575d69e5c46498fa00
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But of course, my voice had no way of reaching him,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and he proceeded to remove my "
"clothing, piece by piece,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫当然ながら私の声は、⟪k:2⟫兄に届かず――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼は淡々と服を剥ぎ、⟪k:5⟫私の肌"
"を、⟪k:6⟫肉体を――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1DCF0803_C04F_40B6_958E_B00ADB3E0CED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac4570bf64d30ac1d29f68e4ba6fb49aa3af47dbd00e8c62fdd415c64d94d7a3
#. default-sha256: c31f8ef3faffce4e34816ecd6df24df6187ab9f659263df42d736ad744baab82
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1DCF0803_C04F_40B6_958E_B00ADB3E0CED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫until I was left fully nude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫衆目に……晒した。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8239D993_E4CC_494D_AE65_0BC3127CD6EC
