"⟪k:0⟫She was older and bonier than I remembered;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she had bags under her eyes so dark "
"they looked like bruises;⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫her once lustrous blonde hair had faded almost white..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫たとえその容貌が老婆のように衰えていたとしても、⟪k:1⟫眼窩の影はあやうい程に濃く、⟪k:2⟫かつて"
"艶のあった金髪が色を失っていたとしても――"

